  <string name="help_about_content">Version %1$s\n\nNative Android reader for the pagenote project format v1.</string>
  <string name="help_shortcuts_content">External keyboard shortcuts from the desktop reader:\n\nAlt + Left / Right: previous or next page\nCtrl / Cmd + S: save the current note\n\nArrow, Page Up, Page Down, Home, End, and Space scroll the focused document.</string>
  <string name="help_privacy_license_content">PDFs, notes, handwriting, annotations, and OCR stay in the selected project on this device. OCR runs offline. AI requests are sent only after you invoke an AI command, to the OpenAI-compatible endpoint you configured; its API key is encrypted with Android Keystore.\n\nOpen-source components include AndroidX/Compose and Kotlin (Apache-2.0), PDFBox-Android and Markwon (Apache-2.0), AndroidSVG (Apache-2.0), PaddleOCR (Apache-2.0), ONNX Runtime (MIT), the OpenCV Android wrapper (BSD-3-Clause) and OpenCV (Apache-2.0), Mermaid (MIT), and DOMPurify (Apache-2.0/MPL-2.0). License notices are maintained under android/ in the source project.</string>
  <string name="help_diagnostics_content">This report contains app/device metadata only. It excludes project names and paths, note or annotation content, API keys, endpoint URLs, and model names.</string>
